A '''Volcanic Snail''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished from [[Hotspots]] on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
A '''Volcanic Snail''' can be fished up from any [[Hotspot]] in lava. It requires {{skl|fishing|17}} or higher to be fished up.

[[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] have a {{Green|15%}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

