The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Volcanic Snail''' is {{Green|2,875}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|28.75%|1|3.48|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] pool. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

