== Behavior ==
A '''Volcanic Snail''' very slowly moves towards the target player, leaving a trail of fire behind itself. A {{Green|5}} radius ring of fire particles follows the '''Volcanic Snail''', dealing {{Stat|true damage}} to players within it {{Green|2}} times a second.

